-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The files below contain text from third-party datasets (reference transcripts used to score
models). They are redistributed under their own licences, not under Apache-2.0:

- benchmarks/asr/results/fleurs_tr_test/*.jsonl ("ref" fields)
  FLEURS, Google, https://huggingface.co/datasets/google/fleurs, CC BY 4.0.
  Changes: Turkish test split only; model transcripts added next to the references.

- benchmarks/asr/results/mediaspeech_tr/*.jsonl ("ref" fields)
  MediaSpeech (Turkish), NTR Lab, https://huggingface.co/datasets/ymoslem/MediaSpeech, CC BY 4.0.
